      "notes": "Launched at GIIAS 2026 (pre-booking 30 Jul-9 Aug 2026). No Indonesian variant name published; one AWD version. Price is the GIIAS special pre-booking price Rp1.49 billion; the regular list price (reportedly about Rp1.547 billion) was not confirmed by a source. Power 427.7 PS (= 315 kW). DC 10-80% 24 min on a 350 kW charger. NCM chemistry from a Korean-market report (global spec). CBU/CKD not stated. Motor type, pack voltage, AC/DC charging, connectors, V2L, heat pump, dimensions, ground clearance, boot (behind 3rd row), 10 airbags and tyres from the Australian 110.3 kWh AWD spec sheet (Hyundai Australia; rated 314 kW there).",
      "notes_id": "Diluncurkan di GIIAS 2026 (pemesanan awal 30 Juli-9 Agustus 2026). Tidak ada nama varian Indonesia yang dipublikasikan; satu versi AWD. Harga adalah harga spesial pemesanan awal GIIAS Rp1,49 miliar; harga resmi reguler (kabarnya sekitar Rp1,547 miliar) belum dikonfirmasi sumber. Tenaga 427,7 PS (= 315 kW). DC 10-80% 24 menit dengan charger 350 kW. Kimia baterai NCM dari laporan pasar Korea (spesifikasi global). Status CBU/CKD tidak disebutkan. Jenis motor, tegangan paket, pengisian AC/DC, konektor, V2L, heat pump, dimensi, ground clearance, bagasi (di belakang baris ke-3), 10 airbag, dan ban dari lembar spesifikasi Australia 110,3 kWh AWD (Hyundai Australia; di sana 314 kW)."
